(53, 1, 'Beginner', 1, 1, 1, 'What is JDK, JRE and JVM, why is it needed in Java, and what core problem does it solve?', 'JDK (Java Development Kit)**: A full-featured software development environment containing tools to develop, compile, debug, and execute Java programs.', '- **JDK (Java Development Kit)**: A full-featured software development environment containing tools to develop, compile, debug, and execute Java programs.
