(53, 1, 'Advanced', 3, 1, 1, 'What tricky edge cases, common pitfalls, or interview traps are associated with JDK, JRE and JVM?', '### Common Pitfalls & Mistakes', '### Common Pitfalls & Mistakes
- Thinking JRE contains `javac` (JRE cannot compile `.java` files; trying to run `javac` on a JRE-only machine throws `command not found`).
- Confusing JVM with JDK (JDK is an installable SDK; JVM is the running virtual machine instance).

