- "JVM is the virtual engine that executes bytecode, manages runtime memory, and interfaces with the underlying operating system."', 'Production edge-case scenarios and code maintenance.', 'From Java 11 onwards, standalone JRE downloads are replaced by custom modular runtimes via `jlink`.');

