(57, 1, 'Advanced', 3, 1, 1, 'What tricky edge cases, common pitfalls, or interview traps are associated with Variables in Java (Local, Instance and Static Variables)?', 'Can we make a local variable static?** No! `static int x = 10;` inside a method causes a compile-time error. Static belongs to class-level scope, not method-level stack frames.', '- **Can we make a local variable static?** No! `static int x = 10;` inside a method causes a compile-time error. Static belongs to class-level scope, not method-level stack frames.
