  simple_meaning = '- **The Inscribed Stone Tablet Analogy**: Think of a String like words carved into a granite stone tablet. You cannot edit the carving. If you want to change "Java" to "Java 21", you must carve an entirely new granite tablet and set your hands on the new one.',
