- `calc.multiply` routes to specific overloaded methods based on argument types during compilation.
- `p.print()` routes to `ModernPrinter.print()` at runtime through dynamic dispatch.',
  real_world_example = '',
  comparison_table = '| Feature | Method Overloading | Method Overriding |
