| **default** | Supported | Supported | Inaccessible | Inaccessible |
| **private** | NOT Allowed | Supported | Inaccessible | Inaccessible |',
  interview_answer = '- "The access matrix defines member visibility from most restrictive (private) to least restrictive (public)."
