(138, 1, 'Advanced', 3, 1, 1, 'What tricky edge cases, common pitfalls, or interview traps are associated with Thread Creation: Thread Class vs Runnable Interface?', 'Be cautious with null handling, type compatibility, and concurrency rules with Thread Creation: Thread Class vs Runnable Interface.', '| Dimension | Extending Thread Class | Implementing Runnable Interface |
